{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37235","headline":"夏日湖上即事寄晋陵萧明府 · 章谒","name":"夏日湖上即事寄晋陵萧明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭午羲和驻火轮，开门嘉树庇湖濆。\n行来宾客奇茶味，睡起儿童带簟纹。\n屋小有时投树影，舟轻不觉入鸥羣。\n陶家岂是无诗酒，公退堪惊日已曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}